# `use_pixi` runs `pixi install` in the workspace it activates, so the pixi fixture
# materialises an environment inside the checkout. Nothing here creates a .direnv/ -
# direnv only does that for layout-style directives (layout python, use nix, or an
# explicit direnv_layout_dir), and none of the directives in setup-direnv/lib use one.
setup-direnv/test/fixture-pixi/.pixi/
